#. <CLT 4>誰にも知られたくない<CLT><CLT 3>過去<CLT><CLT 4>や<CLT><CLT 3>思い出<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>Secrets<CLT><CLT 4> or <CLT><CLT 3>memories<CLT><CLT 4> you don't want anyone to know\n"
"about...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それらも、ボクらと外の世界を結ぶ、
#. 立派なキーワード…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A way to connect to the outside world...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんなモノクマの言葉に、
#. 正直、ボクはピンときていなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Honestly, all that crap Monokuma was spouting didn't\n"
"have any effect on me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな事の為に、殺人なんて起きる訳がない。
#. ボクはそう思い込んでいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no way anyone would kill over stuff like that.\n"
"At least, that's what I thought.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…でも、楽観視していただけなのかもしれない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But maybe I was just being optimistic.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、大した緊張感を抱く事もないまま…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which is probably why, without too much of a\n"
"struggle...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんだか疲れてるのかな…
#. 今日は、やけに眠い…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Jeez, I'm more tired than usual. Super tired today..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ボクは眠りに落ちた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I fell asleep.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その時、すでに進行していた<CLT><CLT 3>“悲劇”<CLT><CLT 4>の事なんて…
#. これっぽっちも知らずに。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But what I didn't know is that even then...a <CLT><CLT 3>tragedy<CLT><CLT 4>\n"
"was taking place.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと、ボクの話に
#. 付き合ってもらってもいいかな？
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hey, do you have a second? I wanna confide in you..."
msgstr ""

#. 世界に対しての態度と言うか…
msgctxt "0011 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's about the prevailing world attitude right now."
msgstr ""

#. “能動的”と“受動的”との差と言うか…
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "The difference between passive and active. I mean..."
msgstr ""

#. 例えば、『殺しちゃった』と『殺した』の差に
#. ついてなんだけど…
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"For example, it's the difference between like, \"Oops!\n"
"I killed him,\" and, \"Yeah that's right. I killed him.\""
msgstr ""

#. この違いがわかってない人って、
#. 意外に多いんだよね。
msgctxt "0014 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Amazingly, there are tons of people who don't\n"
"understand the difference. Can you believe it!?"
msgstr ""

#. 『殺しちゃった』と『殺した』は全然違うんだよ。
#. ボクの言ってる意味わかるでしょ？
msgctxt "0015 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But there's a HUGE difference between \"Oops!\" and\n"
"\"That's right.\" You know what I'm saying, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 『殺しちゃった』は、誰にでも出来るけど、
#. 『殺した』を出来る人って、意外に少ないんだ。
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Anyone can kill someone in the heat of the moment. But\n"
"surprisingly few can do it with calculated intent."
msgstr ""

#. 冷静に考え判断を下し、行動に移すのって、
#. 感情で動くのより、ずっと難しいんだよね。
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"To make that choice, then put it into action, it's way\n"
"harder than just letting your emotions lead you."
msgstr ""

#. 覚悟が必要なんだよ、覚悟がね。
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's all about preparation. Resolve."
msgstr ""

#. で、何が言いたいのかって？　
#. それはね…
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So maybe you're wondering, what's the point I'm trying\n"
"to make?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクにもサッパリなんだ。
#. 行間を読んでくれたまえよ。
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm not totally sure myself. Maybe you should\n"
"try reading between the lines."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0021 | NO NAME"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …………よ…う…
msgctxt "0022 | NO NAME"
msgid "...morn...ing."
msgstr ""

#. ……お…は……
msgctxt "0023 | NO NAME"
msgid "...goo...d..."
msgstr ""

#. お…は…よう……
msgctxt "0024 | NO NAME"
msgid "Goo..d...morning..."
msgstr ""

#. おはようございます。
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Good morning!"
msgstr ""

#. う、うわぁぁぁぁ！！
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Uwaaaaahh!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…ナイスなリアクション…
#. やっぱ、キミって期待を裏切らないよねぇ～！
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Upupu! Nice reaction! I'm glad to see you didn't\n"
"disappoint!"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだよ！　何しに来たッ！！
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What...!? What are you doing here!?"
msgstr ""

#. 趣向を変えてみました！
#. 校内放送じゃなくて、直接起こしに来たのッ！！
msgctxt "0029 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I wanted to spice things up! So instead of a school\n"
"announcement, I decided to wake you up in person!"
msgstr ""

#. なんの為に…！？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What the hell for!?"
msgstr ""

#. おもろいから。
msgctxt "0031 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Because it's fun."
msgstr ""

#. それと…せっかくだから、
#. ボクの口から教えてあげようと思ってさ…
msgctxt "0032 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And as long as I'm here, I figured I'd let you hear it\n"
"right from the bear's mouth."
msgstr ""

#. 何をだよ…？
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hear what?"
msgstr ""

#. いいのかなぁ～？　
#. そんなに、のんびりしちゃって！
msgctxt "0034 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Are you sure you should be acting this laid back?"
msgstr ""

#. 仲良しクラスメイトの誰かさんに、
#. <CLT 3>“何かあった”<CLT>みたいなのにさぁ！
msgctxt "0035 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I mean, even though <CLT 3>something happened<CLT> to one of\n"
"your buddy-buddy classmates?"
msgstr ""

#. は…？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. はにゃにゃ、どったの？
#. 顔色が死に損ないみたいな青色だけども。
msgctxt "0037 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Wuhwuhwuh-what? Your face is all blue, like someone on\n"
"the verge of death!"
msgstr ""

#. な、何かあったって…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...what happened?"
msgstr ""

#. …どういう意味だよ！！
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What are you talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、それを確かめるのはオマエラの仕事！
msgctxt "0040 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu! That's for me to know, and you to find out!"
msgstr ""

#. 頑張ってね～ッ！
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Good luuuck!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かに…何かあったって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something's happened to someone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そ、それって…もしかして！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is it...? Was it—!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そんなはずない…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No, it can't be..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事…あるはずがないんだ…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There's no way someone would..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、もし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...what if...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、“もし”なんて事を考えても仕方がない。
#. とにかく今は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, \"what if\"s are pointless. Especially now, when...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …食堂だ。まずは食堂に急ごう！
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...The dining hall. I need to get to the dining hall!"
msgstr ""
